// {R} 1/1: "{T}: choose new targets for target spell." Modeled on the
// tap-pinger shape (Creature tap-activated DealDamage AnyTarget.ron) and the
// CopySpell fixture, but re-targeting a COMMITTED stack entry via
// `PlayerAction::ChooseNewTargets` ([CR#707.10c,115.7d]) instead of minting a
// copy — the engine-copy-spells end-to-end fixture for `ChooseNewTargets`.
Normal(
    name: "Creature tap-activated ChooseNewTargets Target Spell",
    mana_cost: [Red],
    types: [Creature],
    power: 1,
    toughness: 1,
    abilities: [
        Activated(cost: [Tap], effect: Targeted(targets: [TargetOne(Kind(Spell))], effect: ChooseNewTargets(of: Target(0), by: You))),
    ],
)
